## Interface: 11509
## Title: TOGBankClassic
## Notes: A simple way to aggregate, view and request items from the inventories of multiple guild bank alts.
## Author: Dominion-Myzrael, GrumpyPlayers (also known as <SG>Soul), Lothsahn, Huntmehuntme-Myzrael, Pimptasty
## Version: @project-version@

## SavedVariables: TOGBankClassicDB, TOGBankClassicIconDB, TOGBankClassicOptionDB, TOGBankClassicDB_DebugLog, TOGBankClassic_PerfMetrics, TOGBankClassic_PerfEnabled, TOGBankClassic_DebugLogEnabled
## Dependencies: Ace3, VersionCheck-1.0, GuildRoster, AceCommQueue-1.0
## OptionalDeps: Bagnon
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1400244

# Libraries. Everything shared is a declared dependency rather than a vendored copy, so
# there is exactly one resolved version per library and no chance of shipping a stale one.
# LibStub comes with Ace3.
#
# ACQ-001: AceCommQueue-1.0 was vendored here until v1.4.0. The shipped copy had drifted to
# MINOR 2 while the standalone reached 5 -- and MINOR 5 is where a refused send is finally
# reported as failed rather than delivered (LIBREQ-ACQ-004). A vendored copy that silently
# lags is exactly the failure the dependency declaration prevents.
Libs/LibDataBroker-1.1/LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs/LibDBIcon-1.0/LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

# Modules
# Compat re-establishes bare globals the client removed (C_* migration); load first
# so the aliases exist before any other module's runtime calls.
Modules/Compat.lua
Modules/Constants.lua
Modules/Output.lua
Modules/Performance.lua
# Static data tables (generated by tools/build-itemdb.py from wago.tools DB2
# dumps; load early so anything that queries item class has them available)
Modules/Static/ItemDB.lua
Modules/Static/SuffixDB.lua
Modules/DeltaComms.lua
Modules/Bank.lua
Modules/Chat.lua
Modules/Database.lua
Modules/Events.lua
Modules/Guild.lua
Modules/P2PSession.lua
Modules/RequestLog.lua
Modules/Item.lua
Modules/ItemHighlight.lua
Modules/TooltipBankerInfo.lua
Modules/Mail.lua
Modules/MailInventory.lua
Modules/Options.lua
Modules/UI.lua
Modules/UI/Donations.lua
Modules/UI/StatusBar.lua
Modules/UI/Inventory.lua
Modules/UI/Mail.lua
Modules/UI/Minimap.lua
Modules/UI/Requests.lua
Modules/UI/Search.lua
Modules/Tests.lua

Core.lua
